<title>USA: ClinTrials off after large block trades.</title>
<headline>ClinTrials off after large block trades.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ClinTrials Research Inc's share price slipped in early trading Wednesday after a major shareholder sold some large blocks of the stock.</p>
<p>The shares were off 11/16 to 7-5/16 and earlier touched a new 52-week low of seven.</p>
<p>At 1028 EDT/1428 GMT, two large blocks of ClinTrials were traded within 15 seconds of each other. The first was 1.2 million shares and the second was 1.5 million.</p>
